0 Articulated Dark Green Serpent
0 Name: model.ldr
0 Author: Codex
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // 14 repeated scales, a shaped head, and a two-stage articulated tail.
0 // Dark Green = 288; Tan = 19; concealed friction joints = 72.
0 // Every joint is a real 8 mm LEGO ball/socket connection.
0 // All y=4 joint centres coincide; maximum relative yaw is 20 degrees.
0 // Pose by rotating complete segments around their shared ball centres.
0 // Each body segment has incoming ball (-30,4,0) and socket (30,4,0).
0 // Set all segment yaw angles to zero and centres 60 LDU apart for a straight pose.
1 288 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 serpent_head.ldr
0 STEP
